#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:3
#: 5ff8dd9fcb894d39829dc38b1ce3eb0f
msgid "设置磁矩（Set Magnetic Moments）"
msgstr "Set Magnetic Moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:5
#: 67114bea8e354d80a576466c69de5263
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:7
#: 07f5156de6f745c5ae8cff7e20788424
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:9
#: dd6b30f37c78428ab70f9c65840fa087
msgid ""
"把输入结构写成统一的 `spin:R:3` 表示。选择磁矩来源（已有磁矩 / 元素映射 / 常数幅值）、输出格式（标量 / "
"向量）、参考轴方向和生效元素范围。这是一张基础层卡片——不生成多磁序分支，只为后续磁性卡片提供干净、统一的初始磁矩。内部仍同步维护 ASE "
"`initial_magmoms` 兼容别名。"
msgstr ""
"Write a consistent `spin:R:3` representation to each input structure. Choose the "
"moment source—existing values, an element map, or a constant magnitude—the scalar or "
"vector output format, a reference axis, and the elements to which it applies. This "
"foundational card does not branch into multiple magnetic orders; it prepares a clean,"
" uniform starting state for downstream magnetic cards. The internal ASE "
"`initial_magmoms` compatibility alias is kept in sync."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:11
#: a434d619b7884ec693e69b8bb7d6abd7
msgid ""
"**和 `Magnetic Order` 的区别：** `Magnetic Order` 从一个母相出发生成 FM+AFM+PM "
"多分支。本卡只标准化磁矩格式，不创建新磁序。如果你的流程里多张磁性卡都在重复配 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）和 "
"`轴`（`axis`），用本卡统一初始化一次可以消除重复。"
msgstr ""
"**Difference from `Magnetic Order`:** `Magnetic Order` generates FM, AFM, and PM "
"branches from one parent phase. This card only standardizes the magnetic-moment "
"representation; it does not create a new magnetic order. If several downstream "
"magnetic cards repeat the same `magmom_map` and `axis`, initialize them once here."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:13
#: bdab3c798f724e038d60b879e4fc591c
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:15
#: 228bd45ffbf441caa09c604e64c1c00a
msgid "这张卡执行的是确定性映射而不是磁结构求解。对元素为 $e$ 的原子 $i$，标量模式写入"
msgstr "This card performs a deterministic mapping rather than solving for a magnetic structure. For atom $i$ of element $e$, scalar mode writes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:17
#: c702007909534bb49f0c776b934ad735
msgid ""
"\n"
"m_i=M(e),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:21
#: bb102b692d3642aea19168077c24b740
msgid "非共线模式写入"
msgstr "Non-collinear mode writes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:23
#: 5fa2cba3fb0d4d1da600c24e6f62693f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M(e)\\,\n"
"\\frac{\\mathbf a_e}{\\|\\mathbf a_e\\|},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:28
#: 38ff040f55444d4bb14428f6d06e7485
msgid ""
"其中 $M(e)$ 来自元素-磁矩表，$\\mathbf a_e$ 来自元素方向表；没有独立方向时使用全局 参考轴。未列元素按“默认磁矩”处理。数值单位为 "
"$\\mu_B$。它只设置 `initial_magmoms` 初始标签，不会计算交换作用、自动判断磁性元素或保证 DFT 收敛到该磁态。"
msgstr ""
"Here $M(e)$ comes from the element-moment map and $\\mathbf a_e$ from the element-direction map; "
"when no element-specific direction is given, the global reference axis is used. Unlisted elements "
"use the default moment. Values are in $\\mu_B$. The card only sets the initial `initial_magmoms` "
"labels; it neither computes exchange interactions nor identifies magnetic elements automatically, "
"and it cannot guarantee that DFT converges to the requested magnetic state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:32
#: 781945e218664a3db4d9987a6b91c0ee
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:34
#: 642952ae3bfa40c08978e9f50b93f28f
msgid "场景：多张磁性卡各自配 magmom_map，配错了一处"
msgstr "Scenario: repeated `magmom_map` settings drift out of sync across magnetic cards"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:36
#: a5e215c4b3714f6f85feb146294c319f
msgid ""
"你的训练流水线里有 `Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic Response` → `SOC / Texture Response` "
"三张磁性卡。如果在多张卡里重复填写元素磁矩，两周后调整 Co 的磁矩时很容易漏改其中一处，导致同一批数据使用不一致的幅值。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose a training pipeline contains `Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic Response` → "
"`SOC / Texture Response`. If element moments are entered repeatedly on several cards,"
" a later change to the Co moment can easily be missed in one place, causing "
"inconsistent magnitudes within the same dataset."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:38
#: 9a81832c133b40a49a556229b41df28c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 磁性流水线里，磁矩幅值的定义应该只在一处。用本卡在最前面做一次统一初始化，后续磁性卡全部选 \"Existing initial magmoms\" "
"模式，不再各自定义 magmom_map。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Define moment magnitudes once in a magnetic workflow. Put this card "
"first, then select `Existing initial magmoms` in downstream cards instead of "
"redefining the element map repeatedly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:40
#: 6b8798a1ef8847c3b64384c5b3dd7072
msgid "**输入：** 一个磁性晶体结构，还没写 `spin` 或 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr "**Input:** A magnetic crystal structure without `spin` or `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:42
#: 45e4220ffe3640a28884cc01468dd163
msgid "**目标：** 统一写入向量格式的初始磁矩，Fe 取 2.2 μB，Co 取 1.7 μB，沿 z 轴，后续卡片全部复用"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Initialize vector moments along *z*, using 2.2 μB for Fe and 1.7 μB for Co,"
" then reuse them throughout the downstream workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:44
#: 6a11bea9da3c4de8ad4b3e033bfc7c66
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:45
#: b6e94063a3f94276ab17d81623173f71
msgid "`来源`（`source`） = `Map/default magnitude`"
msgstr "`Source` (`source`) = `Map/default magnitude`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:46
#: 23d60aa40ec8441c8f65986c83d12936
msgid "`格式`（`format`） = `Non-collinear (vector)`"
msgstr "`Format` (`format`) = `Non-collinear (vector)`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:47
#: 6acb6521a4b24ef2ae4bddf118da8a89
msgid "`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`） = `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`"
msgstr "`Element moment map` (`magmom_map`) = `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:48
#: c82b6e25e40845dcaf63214016a1fa20
msgid "`Apply Elements` = `Fe,Co`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:50
#: ddb686d42c264182be7c0b2a84246ec9
msgid "**输出：** 1 个结构，带 `MagSet(map,vec)` 标签和 `spin:R:3` 数组。原子位置和数量不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** One structure labeled `MagSet(map,vec)` with a `spin:R:3` array. Atomic "
"positions and counts are unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:52
#: 4ffd8183841d485995e9d137978db290
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:53
#: 5f5f97988ce845d7936ed2f54beee5cc
msgid "后续磁性卡全部切到 \"Existing initial magmoms\"，检查输出磁矩幅值是否一致"
msgstr ""
"Set all downstream magnetic cards to `Existing initial magmoms` and verify that "
"moment magnitudes remain consistent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:54
#: 2487957b10544a0ea3a9fb806b5dcd63
msgid "如果 Co 的磁矩需要精确到实验值，直接用 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）的精确定义"
msgstr "If the Co moment must match a specific experimental value, enter that value explicitly in the element moment map (`magmom_map`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:55
#: bb583dae562a47679f85447fdc92a07e
msgid "如果后续要同时跑标量和向量流程，分别用本卡输出两种格式的版本，而不是在后面卡片里切换"
msgstr ""
"If both scalar and vector workflows are needed, create one standardized branch for "
"each format here instead of switching representations later."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:57
#: 195cecf46e28415ca3f45e87c8a5bf5f
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:59
#: f7197e562d3949e8a7950936b8313dc9
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:60
#: e2f7dc516e044c359c80f7adcba5c3a9
msgid "流水线里多张磁性卡都在重复配置磁矩幅值、格式、axis"
msgstr "Several magnetic cards repeat the same moment magnitudes, format, and axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:61
#: 7d0d764a68b1464baa019ac27049cf54
msgid "输入结构的磁矩格式不统一（有的标量有的向量），需要标准化"
msgstr "Input structures mix scalar and vector moments and must be standardized."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:62
#: 1e3fa843473b4fd8a3ab18c827ae0b09
msgid "只想初始化参考 FM 磁矩，不想生成多磁序分支"
msgstr ""
"You need one reference FM initialization without branching into several magnetic "
"orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:64
#: 017e5e40dc2844c9a605ccff595836a6
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:65
#: 323e2e9c38c2430b922baf35a01032d4
msgid "只有一张磁性卡且不共享磁矩配置 → 直接在目标卡上配也可以"
msgstr ""
"Only one magnetic card uses the settings → configuring that card directly may be "
"simpler."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:66
#: 30f4383a06c14f98b48886b2a827a011
msgid "需要一次性生成 FM/AFM/PM 多磁序 → 用 `Magnetic Order` 一步完成"
msgstr "You need FM, AFM, and paramagnetic-like branches → use `Magnetic Order`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:68
#: ff641795dfc54faf91b8283303a5a38c
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:70
#: 9c7cbfe5c4434c829700f4669311db39
msgid "磁矩来源"
msgstr "Moment source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:72
#: 3c69cbd281aa4366b2d682d53da15f4e
msgid "来源（source）"
msgstr "source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:74
#: f88ca0995a2d4bf3bcfc4ceba6f45b02
msgid "`str`，默认 `'Map/default magnitude'`。磁矩从哪里来。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Map/default magnitude'`. Source from which moment values are "
"obtained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 6647439bb67741a0afddd06946c1b11c
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 6ba9f7212a1a4f2d9926f52bf044a925
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 96c1875abe98402b87bcc27185aff3f0
msgid "`Map/default magnitude`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: f7103cd595f140c19ac625dbdf8897af
msgid "用 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`） / `默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）生成。输入不需要已有磁矩"
msgstr "Generate moments from the element moment map (`magmom_map`) and default moment (`default_moment`). The input does not need existing moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: e1ead44857564ac497586ffd0668509e
msgid "`Existing initial magmoms`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: e8620f7a8be941898dd3cc03a4fc9794
msgid "保留输入已有的磁矩，只做格式转换。输入需要已有 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr ""
"Preserve existing moment values and convert only their representation; the input must"
" contain `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 83a69cb3f6ad4d208ccfb55a35773d5d
msgid "`Constant magnitude`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: b930c14cd8054835914ffd726601209a
msgid "所有目标元素统一用一个常数幅值，适合快速扫参考值"
msgstr ""
"Assign one constant magnitude to all target elements; useful for a quick reference-"
"value scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:82
#: 297e8139481f45e3818973b03fe4a673
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:84
#: c84471a62e2947a8a9c60ab310d28272
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。界面使用“元素 / 磁矩或向量”表格；标量可填 `2.2`，向量可填 `[0,0,1.0]`。序列化仍兼容 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6` 和"
" `{\"Cr\":[0,0,1.0]}`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. The interface uses an `Element / Moment or vector` table; enter "
"`2.2` for a scalar or `[0,0,1.0]` for a vector. Serialization remains compatible with"
" `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6` and `{\"Cr\":[0,0,1.0]}`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:86
#: 048fb2448a36450580cb30e8df015ef4
msgid "使用元素方向（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr "use_element_dirs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:88
#: e476572edb50403bb1751637a7f42709
msgid "`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）中提供的向量方向会被保留，而不是统一投到 `轴`（`axis`）。仅向量格式下有意义。"
msgstr "`bool`, default `False`. When enabled, vector directions supplied in `magmom_map` are preserved instead of being projected onto `axis`. This setting only applies to vector output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:90
#: ccba322ea3554213924d5696bcef262a
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:92
#: 3b87b263c0bc4b738b1218ea75458986
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的默认幅值。设 0 则不给未配置元素写磁矩。"
msgstr "`float`, default `0.0`. Default magnitude for elements not present in `magmom_map`. A value of 0 leaves unconfigured elements without a moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:94
#: 4d56d4d1131a4ca78d2484e338d976d4
msgid "固定磁矩（constant_moment）"
msgstr "constant_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:96
#: 875015cea5cb41f7ad91d508318dbf85
msgid "`float`，默认 `2.0`。`Source = Constant magnitude` 时所有目标元素的统一幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `2.0`. Magnitude assigned to every target element when `Source = "
"Constant magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:98
#: 63c346b54ae14390aee5ea7b4f70c11d
msgid "输出格式"
msgstr "Output representation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:100
#: 903c8dee62cb41b5a6ad257e6b73ef21
msgid "格式（format）"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:102
#: 6313031519af4796920c04611fc3bdef
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Non-collinear (vector)'`。`Collinear (scalar)` 或 `Non-collinear "
"(vector)`。后续要做旋转、螺旋、canting 时优先选向量格式。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Non-collinear (vector)'`. Choose `Collinear (scalar)` or `Non-"
"collinear (vector)`. Use vectors for downstream rotation, spiral, or canting "
"operations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:104
#: 20ee6193a158480f8e61f97566ddaf91
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:106
#: a03c9bf070364673adc592a97eff2a21
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量且目标格式是向量时，是否沿 `轴`（`axis`）抬升。通常保持开启。"
msgstr "`bool`, default `True`. When scalar input is converted to vector output, lift it along `axis`. Normally leave this enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:108
#: d27efa79771440eea30a66652cce8c03
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:110
#: 150b388ac2264a5dafede48ee6420090
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。向量输出的参考方向、标量抬升的方向，格式为"
" `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. Reference "
"direction for generated vectors and for lifting scalar moments, expressed as `[x, y, "
"z]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:112
#: bb02ff7d25854236a339385f0186fd0b
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:114
#: 074b24b7f07d4462b6f8c7f64215ac2f
msgid "元素范围"
msgstr "Element scope"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:116
#: 0b92c5a943f547c28278e2f0a773645e
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:118
#: dbef0f48d4ee4b758a2139ce85f93214
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。逗号分隔如 `Fe,Co`，只对列出的元素写磁矩，其余写 0。留空则全部生效。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Comma-separated element symbols such as `Fe,Co`. Only listed "
"elements receive moments; others are set to zero. Leave empty to include all "
"elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:120
#: 8ebe588305004f658e2714c5b986b931
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:122
#: bce423d62003496385409cfdfe6b13b7
msgid "标准化现有磁矩为向量（不改变幅值，适合接入已有数据）"
