#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:175
#: e83f947c69bf442eb938e126e066e101
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Magnetic Order`：先统一磁矩格式，再生成 FM/AFM/PM 磁序"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Magnetic Order`: standardize representation, then generate "
"FM, AFM, and paramagnetic-like orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:176
#: 3ec0a0a493b94be1888c96a9b5b9a0e7
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Local Magnetic Response`：先生成统一 FM 向量磁矩，再做局域响应扫描"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Local Magnetic Response`: create consistent FM vector "
"moments before scanning local responses"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:177
#: dc425a39cb154a1082615100469c783a
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `SOC / Texture Response`：先写入稳定模长，再生成有限 q 磁纹理"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `SOC / Texture Response`: establish stable moment magnitudes"
" before generating finite-q magnetic textures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:179
#: 5486fffc113342d9ad200949149bca01
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:181
#: 1fb221eeabab4988ac946398009ab28c
msgid ""
"**输出没有磁矩。** 检查 `来源`（`source`）模式是否匹配输入。`Existing` 模式优先读取 `spin:R:3`，没有时才读取旧 "
"`initial_magmoms`。`Map/default` 需要填写 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）或合理的 "
"`默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）。"
msgstr ""
"**The output has no magnetic moments.** Check that `source` matches the input. `Existing` first "
"reads `spin:R:3` and falls back to legacy `initial_magmoms`; `Map/default` requires an element "
"moment map (`magmom_map`) or a suitable default moment (`default_moment`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:183
#: 1e2a543063064631a4906f74fbf83fb6
msgid ""
"**标量磁矩没变成向量。** `标量磁矩转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）没开，且 `格式`（`format`）选了向量但输入只有标量。开启 "
"`标量磁矩转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）。"
msgstr "**Scalar moments were not converted to vectors.** Vector output was selected but `lift_scalar` is disabled. Enable `Convert scalar moments to vectors` (`lift_scalar`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:185
#: 2be5b3f8927c4c1aad6bfa338dd6f010
msgid "**某些元素磁矩被意外清零。** 检查 `应用元素`（`apply_elements`）是否为非空且遗漏了目标元素。"
msgstr "**Moments on some elements were unexpectedly cleared.** Check whether the nonempty `apply_elements` list omits the intended element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:187
#: e381b057449e45bb808e76cfd3d5ce18
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:189
#: 99b421685ef2438abcfa888f8baffe32
msgid "`MagSet(existing,sca)` / `MagSet(map,vec)` / `MagSet(const,vec)` 等：标记磁矩来源和输出格式"
msgstr ""
"`MagSet(existing,sca)`, `MagSet(map,vec)`, or `MagSet(const,vec)`, recording the "
"moment source and output representation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:191
#: 9d1a53f80ab44b449f0cc1eebde06124
msgid "所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`。标量格式必须提供非零 `轴`（`axis`），程序据此构造三分量自旋，不会静默假设方向。"
msgstr "Every exported output writes `spin:R:3`. Scalar format requires a nonzero `axis`, which is used to construct three-component spins; the program never assumes a direction silently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:193
#: c8df298f331a44c1bce11914946f46dd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:195
#: 368ba645870b462f92b0c9adf5d2ea61
msgid "无随机性。相同输入、相同 `来源`（`source`）和相同参数 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr "There is no randomness. Identical input, `source`, and parameters produce identical output."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**和 `Magnetic Order` 的区别：** `Magnetic Order` "
#~ "从一个母相出发生成 FM+AFM+PM 多分支。本卡只标准化磁矩格式，不创建新磁序。如果你的流程里多张磁性卡都在重复配 "
#~ "`magmom_map` 和 `axis`，用本卡统一初始化一次可以消除重复。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**How this differs from `Magnetic Order`:** "
#~ "`Magnetic Order` branches one parent structure "
#~ "into FM, AFM, and paramagnetic-like states."
#~ " This card only standardizes moment values "
#~ "and representation. Use it once at the "
#~ "beginning when several downstream cards would "
#~ "otherwise repeat the same `magmom_map` and "
#~ "`axis` settings."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你的训练流水线里有 `Magnetic Order` → `Small-Angle Spin"
#~ " Tilt` → `Spin Spiral` 三张磁性卡。每张卡都有一个 `magmom_map`"
#~ " 输入框，你填了三遍 `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`。两周后改 Co 的磁矩为 "
