#~ msgid "**某些元素磁矩被意外清零。** 检查 `apply_elements` 是否为非空且遗漏了目标元素。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Some elements were unintentionally set to "
#~ "zero.** Check whether a nonempty `apply_elements`"
